cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below. Cite the original NASA C-MAPSS source separately when using its data."
title: "Turbofan Remaining Useful Life Observatory"
type: software
authors:
  - name: Shantanu
repository-code: "https://github.com/shaxntanu/Turbofan-RUL-Prediction-using-LSTM"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - remaining useful life
  - turbofan
  - prognostics
  - NASA C-MAPSS
  - reliability
abstract: >-
  A research-oriented Python benchmark and dashboard project for turbofan remaining
  useful life prediction on simulated NASA C-MAPSS trajectories. It includes a
  Ridge baseline, optional TensorFlow LSTM, reliability analyses, and static results
  applications. It is not validated for operational maintenance decisions.
